# Social creative

Follow skill **`social-creative`** (`.agent/skills/social-creative/SKILL.md`) for any off-app marketing image or video.

- Flat solid tones from `src/theme.ts` only (palette v3: emerald `brand`, graphite `night`/`graphite`, near-neutral lights). No gradients, glows, blur or grain. Never green text on a green plane of similar depth; on `brand` the accent is pale mint `onBrand`.
- One hook, one visual, one CTA. Brand device = the Path (`src/path.tsx`). Product shown via the CSS phone (`src/device.tsx`, `src/screens.tsx`), never screenshots.
- Every concept is laid out per orientation: story 1080×1920, portrait 1080×1350, square 1080×1080, landscape 1920×1080, link 1200×628, email 1200×600.
- Plus Jakarta Sans 700, hand-set breaks, one accent phrase. Copy per `human-copy`. No invented stats or testimonials.
- Per-module feature series lives in `src/features/` (`registry.tsx` → `out/features/<nn-module>/`). New modules reuse `makeFeatureConcept` and the screen kit.
- Review every render (contact sheets, ffmpeg frame grabs) before calling it done.
